    "objetivo": "Say what is happening now and what was in progress with «stare» and the gerundio, say what is about to happen with «stare per», and use «appena», «tra poco» and «da poco». Avoid the English-speaker traps: using «essere» instead of «stare», using the infinitive instead of the gerundio, and using the progressive for plans.",
